						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
						Executive Speaker Notes:
					</span>
					<span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50">Use Left/Right keyboard arrows to navigate</span>
				</div>
				<p id="speaker-note-text" class="text-xs text-base-content/75 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Open the briefing by addressing the bottleneck in deal prep. Highlight that reps spend 35% of their working hours manually stitching together slides and battlecards."
